### Inverse Tangent Function: $f(x) = \tan^{-1}(x)$ or $\arctan(x)$

The inverse tangent function, also known as arctangent, returns the angle whose tangent is the given number. The range of $\tan^{-1}(x)$ is $[-\frac{\pi}{2}, \frac{\pi}{2}]$.

```tikz
